# Track only greenharbor-* agents, skills, shared references, and Codex mirrors.
# Everything else (gstack, keel symlinks, local folders) is ignored, so a
# third-party installer writing into skills/ can never land in git.
/*
!.gitignore
!agents/
!shared/
shared/*
!shared/greenharbor-*/
!shared/greenharbor-*/**
!skills/
skills/*
!skills/greenharbor-*/
!skills/greenharbor-*/**
!codex/
codex/*
!codex/skills/
codex/skills/*
!codex/skills/greenharbor-*/
!codex/skills/greenharbor-*/**

# Local memory inside skill directories
skills/**/memory/
